irst public appearance in North America at Otakon 2008;  and was also a guest at Sakura-Con 2009.  Yamaguchi's third appearance to date has been at Animazement in 2010.\n\nHe is married and has a daughter, Akane Yamaguchi (山口 茜), and a son, Ryunosuke Yamaguchi (山口 竜之介), who also are voice actors.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kappei Yamaguchi, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","biography_language":"en","birthday":"1965-05-23","checked_at":"2026-11-26","deathday":"","filmography":[{"character":"Kechizu (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zKFkzRn1UyE11Jv9CJjVmvmQFvR.jpg","title":"Jujutsu Kaisen","tmdb_id":95479,"type":"tv","year":2020},{"character":"Oberon (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/sJCw9H0PmnJnTYTCx7uiHImOxSg.jpg","title":"The Ancient Magus' Bride","tmdb_id":73833,"type":"tv","year":2017},{"character":"Shigechi (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/saqAUkE10gq9HYczLy5P4EDETfR.jpg","title":"Le bizzarre avventure di JoJo","tmdb_id":45790,"type":"tv","year":2012},{"character":"Feitan (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9WxfAQquTun9ATkV6iAeFHMkqxv.jpg","title":"Hunter x Hunter","tmdb_id":46298,"type":"tv","year":2011},{"character":"InuYasha (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5pMVrmb6tGmNAH0sX7guM9WbrU3.jpg","title":"InuYasha","tmdb_id":35610,"type":"tv","year":2000},{"character":"Usopp (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8f33Q5AuM2G5ZqFeusbIqDjr3cI.jpg","title":"One Piece","tmdb_id":37854,"type":"tv","year":1999},{"character":"Shinichi Kudo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gW14n6xxONXrya8CIDhRe5Ada7U.jpg","title":"Detective Conan","tmdb_id":30983,"type":"tv","year":1996},{"character":"Tombo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/m6Kmv8RPluTikRcQT0kIlTibsfD.jpg","title":"Kiki - Consegne a domicilio","tmdb_id":16859,"type":"movie","year":1989},{"character":"Ranma Saotome ♂ (voice)","poster":"https: